Z||000000||Rex||04-08-2001||03:34 PM||||Hello, my 86 se starts right up and idles<BR>well ( even cold ), but misfires or stutters<BR>while under load mainly in 4 th gear at a lower rmp Its the<BR>2.8 with no mods. I've checked and gauged all<BR>plugs and found no vac leaks.I don't think its<BR>a fuel restriction problem because it runs well at a high rpm.Tonight I will start it and look at the plug wires to see if anything lights up.I welcome any ideas or if anyone else has had this problem.   Thanks!<BR>||||reg||3
